  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass630180F1B44A49AC9F19F9D33B670E82\"><p></p><p>Professor&#160;Stephen Lyon,&#160;Head of Educational Programmes at AKU-ISMC, and Muhammad Aurang Zeb Mughal have&#160;recently published&#160;\"Cultural Models of Nature and Divinity in a Rain Fed Farming Village of Punjab, Pakistan\" in &quot;Cultural Models of Nature Primary Food Producers and Climate Change&quot;, edited by Giovanni Bennardo.&#160;</p><div><a href=\"https&#58;//www.routledge.com/Cultural-Models-of-Nature-Primary-Food-Producers-and-Climate-Change-1st/Bennardo/p/book/9780815356585\" target=\"_blank\">For further information and purchase, please visit&#160;Routledge webpage</a>.</div><p></p></div>",
